flowchart LR
  subgraph FEED[Feeder 208V 3-ph]
    BRK[Upstream breaker]
  end
  subgraph MM[MonoQube Meter Module]
    direction TB
    CT[3x CT + neutral CT]
    VD[Voltage dividers]
    AFE[ADE9000 metering AFE]
    ISO[ISOW7841 reinforced isolation]
    MCU[STM32H573 runtime controller\nTrustZone secure partition]
    SE[SE052F secure element\nFIPS 140-3 L3\nPod Attestation Key]
    FRAM[F-RAM: counter, ledger head]
    NOR[NOR flash: append-only ledger]
    RTC[RTC 1 ppm]
    WD[External watchdog]
    TMP[Temp sensors x4]
    ACC[Accelerometer]
    DOOR[Door / panel reed sensors]
    ILK[Hardware interlock chain\nAND of: MCU enable, watchdog OK,\ndoors closed, no fault]
    K1[Contactor LC1D95BD\npower gate]
    PHY[Ethernet PHY\ntelemetry network only]
  end
  BAY[Compute bay / rack outlets]
  TAG[Bay identity tag\nATECC608B on device carrier]
  NET[Telemetry network\nseparate from compute network]
  BRK --> K1 --> BAY
  CT --> AFE
  VD --> AFE
  AFE --> ISO --> MCU
  MCU <--> SE
  MCU <--> FRAM
  MCU <--> NOR
  MCU <--> RTC
  TMP --> MCU
  ACC --> MCU
  DOOR --> ILK
  WD --> ILK
  MCU --> ILK --> K1
  TAG -- dedicated bay bus, not the payload --> MCU
  MCU --> PHY --> NET
